<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your BD Blood verification code</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8fafc; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,.05); }
    .header { padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    .logo { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; font-style: ; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .accent { color: #059669; }
    .content { padding: 48px 40px; }
    .code { margin: 32px auto; padding: 20px 24px; max-width: 260px; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff1f2; color: #b91c1c; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 12px; text-align: center; }
    .footer { padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; background: #fdfdfd; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { .content { padding: 32px 24px; } .code { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: 8px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="header"><span class="logo">BD<span class="accent">BLOOD</span></span></div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;">Verify your account</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">Hello <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">Enter this 6-digit code on the BD Blood verification screen to confirm your email address:</p>
        <div class="code"><%= otp %></div>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;">This code expires in <strong><%= expiresInMinutes %> minutes</strong> and can only be used once. For your security, never share it with anyone.</p>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">If you did not create a BD Blood account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> BD Blood. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0;">Bangladesh's life-saving blood donor network.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="padding-top: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
